# Author:        David Gilinsky
# File:          /usr/local/lib/nightwatcher-pi/nw-redirect
# Purpose:       Answer plain HTTP on port 80 and send the caller to the HTTPS
#                web UI. A volunteer who types the unit's name without a scheme
#                gets http:// from most browsers; without this they would meet a
#                connection refused and conclude the appliance is broken.
#
#                Socket-activated, so systemd (as PID 1) opens port 80 and hands
#                the descriptor over. This process therefore needs neither root
#                nor CAP_NET_BIND_SERVICE, and runs as a DynamicUser with no
#                privileges of its own.
# Created:       2026-07-29
